[[Hydra (Crystal Desert)|Hydras]] are three headed reptile [[elementalist]]s that use high damage [[area of effect]] [[Fire Magic|fire spell]]s to bring havoc to unprepared travelers. They are found in packs of 1 to 4 in most of the [[Crystal Desert]].

