==Notes==
*Hydras will usually initiate combat by casting [[Meteor]] unless another Hydra nearby is casting it, in which case they will cast [[Fireball]] first, and then Meteor. (This can cause a continuous [[knock down]] effect if there are a large number of Hydras attacking.)
